Third-party works in this repository
------------------------------------

The 0BSD grant above covers the code and data written for delphitools. The
files below are the work of others, carried in this repository under their
own licences, which continue to apply to them:

  app/components/ui/select.gts, tabs.gts, command.gts, tooltip.gts,
  popover.gts
      Vendored from shadcn-ember v0.2.1 (Ignace Maes), MIT.

  app/lib/editor/footnote-md.ts
      Vendored from markdown-it-footnote 4.0.0, MIT.

  app/lib/substrata/preset-shapes.ts
      SVG path data from Phosphor Icons v2.1.1, MIT
      (Copyright (c) 2023 Phosphor Icons).

  app/lib/pandoc/pandoc-core.js
      The pandoc-wasm JavaScript wrapper, MIT (Tweag I/O Limited, Johannes
      Wilm, and pandoc-wasm contributors). The pandoc.wasm binary itself is
      GPL-2.0-or-later and is not in this repository; the Document Converter
      fetches it from a public CDN at run time.

  public/lib/imagetracer_v1.2.6.js
      imagetracerjs (Andras Jankovics), The Unlicense.

  public/compress/
      jSquash builds of MozJPEG, libwebp, OxiPNG and libavif/aom; see the
      LICENSE.*.md files in that directory.

  public/jxl/
      jSquash build of libjxl (wrapper Apache-2.0, libjxl BSD-3-Clause).

  public/mupdf/
      MuPDF, AGPL-3.0; see LICENSE.mupdf.txt in that directory.

  public/mediainfo/
      MediaInfoLib, BSD-2-Clause; see LICENSE.mediainfo.txt in that
      directory.

  public/fonts/iAWriterQuattroV.woff2, iAWriterQuattroV-Italic.woff2
      iA Writer Quattro (Information Architects), SIL Open Font License 1.1.

  public/fonts/NotoSansShavian-Regular.woff2
      Noto Sans Shavian (Google), SIL Open Font License 1.1.

  public/flags/
      circle-flags (HatScripts), MIT.

  public/data/shavian-dictionary-full.json, app/lib/shavian/dictionary-core.json
      Derived from the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary (Carnegie Mellon
      University), BSD-2-Clause.

  public/data/eff-large-wordlist.txt
      EFF long wordlist (Electronic Frontier Foundation), CC BY 3.0.

  public/substrata/luts/
      Part of the film-emulation LUTs are downsampled from the RawTherapee
      Film Simulation Collection (Pat David, Pavlov Dmitry, Michael Ezra),
      CC BY-SA 4.0; the derived files remain CC BY-SA 4.0. See
      ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md for which, and for the LUTs generated with
      spectral_film_lut.

Artwork is not covered by this licence: the hero art in public/heroes/ and
public/art/, the stickers in public/stickers/, the tiles in public/tiles/,
the Substrata onboarding art in public/substrata/onboarding/ and the
delphi mark remain the property of their artists (credited in
app/lib/hero-art.ts and on the front page) and are used with their
permission.

Models and packages fetched at run time (the background-removal model,
speech-recognition models, pandoc.wasm) and npm dependencies are not part
of this repository and keep their own licences; ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md lists
the notable ones.
